specified. TIC estimates it instead: the effective number of parameters \code{edf} approximates the optimism
\eqn{E[(\hat\theta - \theta^*)^\top H (\hat\theta - \theta^*)] \approx \mathrm{tr}(H \, \mathrm{Var}(\hat\theta))}
